==================================================
8. WHY MOVE WAS MISLEADING
==================================================

Do not use "I can move it in the viewport" as evidence that the MOVE +/- button
works.

The viewport still has its older direct manipulation path:

    click object
      ->
    dragMode = "drag" / "dragY"

and that path changes the object directly.

So there are currently two independent behaviours:

A. viewport drag
    works from selId / dragId

B. toolbar nudge
    works from selIds

If viewport selection fills only selId:

    A works
    B is dead

That is exactly the observed situation.

